	(text "NE555P Output pin can source enough current \nthrough this 100-ohm resistance to\ndecisively close the channel of \nthe IRLI530N FET with no dedicated gate driver. \nIf, however, hotter/longer arcs are necessary, \nI will consider a beefier gate drive setup."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.546 143.256 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.762 0.762)
				(italic yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "2b1c9b7b-9f5a-4077-8412-be5c1cac695f")
	)
	(text "Anti-retrigger & de-bounce; \nAC-coupled Trigger input.\nPull pin LOW to initiate pulse cycle.\nReturn HIGH for time constant of \nthis block to reset before \ntimer can be retriggered."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 137.922 58.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.889 0.889)
				(italic yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "bee76653-d033-438f-a809-4226f70ffded")
	)
	(text "This R-C Network sets pulse-width duration\nequal to the time constant of component values selected.\nThe large 1M potentiometer provides a large\nsweep range -- but is probably more range than required!\nSeries resistor sets minimum duration.\nt(s) = (RV1 + R2) x C3"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 98.552 149.606 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.762 0.762)
				(italic yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "de630d92-feab-4fad-9e15-37eb87c4879f")
	)
